00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,684
But scientists have now found about ten stars that don't fully die.

2
00:00:03,634 --> 00:00:09,634
They lose part of their mass... survive... and drift back around for another pass — months, sometimes years later.

3
00:00:09,634 --> 00:00:11,250
Then it happens again.

